      <p>Beyounge is free to download on Google Play with core workout and food tracking capabilities. Beyounge Pro unlocks unlimited AI Coach guidance, advanced muscle recovery analytics, and 4K exercise demonstrations.</p>

      <h2>2. Free Trial & Billing via Google Play</h2>
      <p>All Beyounge Pro subscriptions billed via Google Play include a 7-day free trial. You can cancel your subscription at any time prior to trial expiration through your Google Play account settings without being charged.</p>

